WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.940
- All right, so let's finish
up with something hopeful

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.290
for Dog Appreciation Month.

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.272
This is "What I'm Liking."

00:00:05.272 --> 00:00:06.568
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.568 --> 00:00:08.816
(audience applauds)

00:00:08.816 --> 00:00:10.770
It's sad to think about
it that thousands of dogs

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.750
are euthanized every year here in LA.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.070
It's truly a crisis

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.930
and that's why it's such a comfort to know

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.870
that there are people like
sisters Ina and Isabelle

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.630
doing their part to save
as many pups as they can.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:25.020
They opened Bubbles Dog Rescue
a year ago, and to date,

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.180
they've saved hundreds of dogs.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.830
We have them on the
line right now watching

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.510
on NBC 4 Los Angeles.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.700
Everybody say hello to Inna and Isabelle.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:33.633
Hello, ladies.

00:00:35.052 --> 00:00:36.248
- Hi.
- Hi!

00:00:36.248 --> 00:00:37.380
- Hi, Kelly.
- Hi, Kelly.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.990
- Hello. So, how did this all get started?

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.060
- Yeah, well, we'd loved
dogs our whole lives

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.430
and then when we found out
about the shelter crisis in LA

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:46.890
and the surrounding counties,
we just knew we had to help.

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:48.870
So we started our own rescue.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.600
Often we pull dogs from shelters

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.210
hours or even minutes before euthanasia.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:56.460
We also remove dogs from abusive homes

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:58.680
and we rescue dogs from
the streets of Mexico

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:01.740
and we provide full
vetting and neuter spay.

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:02.573
- That's amazing.

00:01:02.573 --> 00:01:05.670
So, Isabelle, this is all
run by volunteers, right?

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:06.503
- Yeah, that's right.

00:01:06.503 --> 00:01:09.630
We're actually an all
women run volunteer team,

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.830
and none of us get paid.

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.210
We all have full-time jobs.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:14.667
We depend on public donations

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:17.010
and the general public to save more dogs.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.810
In the last year since we started,

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:21.060
we've saved over 300 lives

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.755
and currently, we have 63
dogs available for adoption.

00:01:24.755 --> 00:01:28.320
The more dogs we get adopted,
the more we can save.

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.295
So, that's why it's so
important to spread awareness

00:01:30.295 --> 00:01:33.900
about the shelter crisis
and also about our rescue.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.580
We absolutely love our community

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:39.030
and hope everyone can join in
supporting Bubbles Dog Rescue.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.560
- Aw, that's incredible guys.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:41.970
Thank you so much, Inna and Isabelle.

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:44.390
I'm liking your post right now, all right?

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:45.223
(bell dings)

00:01:45.223 --> 00:01:46.470
- [Inna And Isabelle] Yay!

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:47.303
- Oh, absolutely.

00:01:47.303 --> 00:01:48.136
Girls, that's not all though.

00:01:48.136 --> 00:01:50.460
Our season long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:52.230
the go-to pen of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:55.110
want to honor truly unstoppable
people just like y'all.

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:56.010
So, they're gonna be writing

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.230
Bubbles Dog Rescue a check
for a thousand dollars.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:01:59.063
How's that sound?

00:01:59.063 --> 00:02:00.464
(crowd cheers)

00:02:00.464 --> 00:02:02.830
- Oh my gosh. Thank you!

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:05.233
- Absolutely, ladies. Way to go.

00:02:05.233 --> 00:02:06.480
I love what you're doing, keep it up.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.279
Thank you to all of our
guests this hour, actually,

00:02:08.279 --> 00:02:11.520
Nicole Byer, Toheeb
Jimoh, Danielle Kartes,

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:12.657
Krista and Lori.

00:02:12.657 --> 00:02:13.650
Y'all have a great day.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.660
If it's not, try and change it.

